<InfoPage title="Contact" kicker="Corrections and rights" description="How to contact Musebox AI Video Guide about factual corrections, source updates, privacy, consent, or rights concerns."><h2>Editorial requests</h2><p>Include the affected URL, the exact statement or asset, the reason for the request, and a primary source that supports the correction.</p><h2>Do not send images or videos</h2><p>We do not need account credentials, source photos, generated videos, identification documents, or sensitive media to review a correction or rights concern.</p><h2>Current route</h2><p>A dedicated domain email will be added after launch. Until then, use the <a href="https://github.com/zanderzou/musebox-fun/issues">public repository issue tracker</a> for non-sensitive corrections and never publish personal data there.</p></InfoPage>
